flowchart TD
    A["#dbg_value record<br/>naming a parameter"] --> F{"location inlined at<br/>a call site ?"}
    F -->|"yes"| F1["routed to that frame:<br/>reported as the inlined<br/>callee's parameter"]
    F -->|"no"| F2["the function's own frame"]
    F1 --> B{"scoped to that frame's<br/>subprogram, and not<br/>a #dbg_declare ?"}
    F2 --> B
    B -->|"no"| X1["ignored: not a description of<br/>this frame's incoming value"]
    B -->|"yes"| D{"a complex DIExpression<br/>rather than the value itself ?"}
    D -->|"yes"| X1
    D -->|"no"| E{"poison, or defined where it<br/>would not dominate the call ?"}
    E -->|"yes"| X2["parameter still reported,<br/>with size 0"]
    E -->|"no"| G["value reported at arg_idx =<br/>DILocalVariable::getArg() - 1"]
